      Up to 8-D.
    axis: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `int32`, `int64`.
      1-D. The indices of the dimensions to reverse. Must be in the range
      `[-rank(tensor), rank(tensor))`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

